sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Pharmacist
    participant UI as React Upload & Review UI
    participant API as FastAPI (/v1/bills)
    participant Worker as Celery / Sync Worker
    participant OCR as PyMuPDF + OpenCV + OCR
    participant AI as ADM + Parser + Cost Calc
    participant DB as Multi-Tenant DB & TrustChain

    User->>UI: Drop PDF or photo invoice
    UI->>API: POST /v1/bills/upload
    API->>DB: Store Bill (QUEUED) & publish BillUploadedEvent
    API-->>UI: Return bill_id (200 OK)
    UI->>UI: Immediate redirect to /review/:billId
    loop Poll every 1.2s until complete
        UI->>API: GET /v1/bills/{id}/status
    end
    Worker->>OCR: Rasterize PDF (PyMuPDF) -> OpenCV crop/deskew
    OCR->>OCR: Cloud Vision (auto-fallback Tesseract --psm 6)
    OCR->>AI: Raw OCR text + word bounding boxes
    AI->>AI: Inject ADM layout hints + Groq / Regex parser
    AI->>AI: RapidFuzz SKU match + Net Landed Cost calculation
    AI->>DB: Persist BillItems + OCR boxes (NEEDS_REVIEW)
    User->>UI: Verify qty, free units, batch, expiry & GST
    User->>API: POST /v1/bills/{id}/confirm
    API->>DB: Commit FEFO Batches + Update ADM & UserMapping
    API->>DB: Append SHA-256 TrustChain + Scan Collisions & Anomalies
